{"page":188,"blocks":[{"x":0.04849,"y":0.05257,"w":0.20386,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"174 Chapter 3: Derivatives"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.093,"w":0.27809,"h":0.01375,"fs":0.01375,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Lenses, Tangents, and Normal Lines"},{"x":0.18518,"y":0.09512,"w":0.04196,"h":0.01023,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Tangent"},{"x":0.11647,"y":0.10341,"w":0.04834,"h":0.01023,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Light ray"},{"x":0.23041,"y":0.11488,"w":0.07051,"h":0.02251,"fs":0.01023,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"Curve of lens surface"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.11766,"w":0.593,"h":0.08952,"fs":0.01279,"n":6,"k":1,"t":"In the law that describes how light changes direction as it enters a lens, the important angles are the angles the light makes with the line perpendicular to the surface of the lens at the point of entry (angles A and B in Figure 3.32). This line is called the normal to the surface at the point of entry. In a profile view of a lens like the one in Figure 3.32, the normal is the line perpendicular (also said to be orthogonal) to the tangent of the profile curve at the point of entry."},{"x":0.04849,"y":0.13531,"w":0.06288,"h":0.01023,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Normal line"},{"x":0.12,"y":0.16571,"w":0.11203,"h":0.02065,"fs":0.01023,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"Point of entry P"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.24039,"w":0.59301,"h":0.03329,"fs":0.01407,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 5 Show that the point (2, 4) lies on the curve x3 + y3 - 9xy = 0. Then find the tangent and normal to the curve there (Figure 3.33)."},{"x":0.04849,"y":0.26125,"w":0.23678,"h":0.05831,"fs":0.01151,"n":5,"k":1,"t":"FIGURE 3.32 The profile of a lens, showing the bending (refraction) of a ray of light as it passes through the lens surface."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.29457,"w":0.593,"h":0.02899,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"Solution The point (2, 4) lies on the curve because its coordinates satisfy the equation given for the curve: 23 + 43 - 9(2)(4) = 8 + 64 - 72 = 0."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.32612,"w":0.59298,"h":0.02814,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"To find the slope of the curve at (2, 4), we first use implicit differentiation to find a formula for dy>dx:"},{"x":0.51242,"y":0.36317,"w":0.13015,"h":0.01795,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"x3 + y3 - 9xy = 0"},{"x":0.23962,"y":0.37276,"w":0.04199,"h":0.02853,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Tangent"},{"x":0.41683,"y":0.39091,"w":0.07986,"h":0.02727,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"d dx (x3) + d"},{"x":0.4849,"y":0.39091,"w":0.08386,"h":0.0276,"fs":0.01401,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"dx (y3) - d"},{"x":0.55697,"y":0.39091,"w":0.08929,"h":0.02727,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"dx (9xy) = d"},{"x":0.63447,"y":0.39812,"w":0.03863,"h":0.02006,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"dx (0)"},{"x":0.22652,"y":0.42352,"w":0.03508,"h":0.03085,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Normal"},{"x":0.4669,"y":0.42771,"w":0.08334,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"dx - 9axdy"},{"x":0.58404,"y":0.42771,"w":0.05853,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"dxb = 0"},{"x":0.39776,"y":0.42848,"w":0.08457,"h":0.02246,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"3x2 + 3y2dy"},{"x":0.72739,"y":0.42983,"w":0.1258,"h":0.02302,"fs":0.01023,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"Differentiate both sides with respect to x."},{"x":0.53481,"y":0.43094,"w":0.06465,"h":0.02727,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"dx + ydx"},{"x":0.0489,"y":0.43335,"w":0.10143,"h":0.01461,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"x3 + y3 − 9xy = 0"},{"x":0.43176,"y":0.46851,"w":0.09278,"h":0.02246,"fs":0.01401,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"(3y2 - 9x) dy"},{"x":0.72739,"y":0.46985,"w":0.13981,"h":0.02303,"fs":0.01023,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"Treat xy as a product and y as a function of x."},{"x":0.50911,"y":0.47302,"w":0.13347,"h":0.02522,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"dx + 3x2 - 9y = 0"},{"x":0.16031,"y":0.49496,"w":0.06112,"h":0.01023,"fs":0.01023,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"0 2"},{"x":0.51639,"y":0.50854,"w":0.09359,"h":0.02246,"fs":0.01401,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"3(y2 - 3x) dy"},{"x":0.59456,"y":0.51679,"w":0.10094,"h":0.02148,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"dx = 9y - 3x2"},{"x":0.59456,"y":0.54717,"w":0.09285,"h":0.03113,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"dy dx = 3y - x2"},{"x":0.04854,"y":0.55074,"w":0.25477,"h":0.04298,"fs":0.01151,"n":4,"k":1,"t":"FIGURE 3.33 Example 5 shows how to find equations for the tangent and normal to the folium of Descartes at (2, 4)."},{"x":0.63451,"y":0.5518,"w":0.18043,"h":0.02813,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"y2 - 3x. Solve for dy>dx."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.59209,"w":0.32217,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"We then evaluate the derivative at (x, y) = (2, 4):"},{"x":0.50967,"y":0.61917,"w":0.07002,"h":0.02386,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"= 3y - x2"},{"x":0.61858,"y":0.6195,"w":0.08238,"h":0.02354,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"= 3(4) - 22"},{"x":0.45537,"y":0.6198,"w":0.01956,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"dy dx `"},{"x":0.52678,"y":0.6198,"w":0.05706,"h":0.03213,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y2 - 3x `"},{"x":0.63565,"y":0.62304,"w":0.14463,"h":0.02889,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":0,"t":"42 - 3(2) = 8 10 = 4 5."},{"x":0.47822,"y":0.64481,"w":0.02412,"h":0.0087,"fs":0.0087,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"(2, 4)"},{"x":0.58713,"y":0.64481,"w":0.02412,"h":0.0087,"fs":0.0087,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"(2, 4)"},{"x":0.32333,"y":0.65817,"w":0.40581,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"The tangent at (2, 4) is the line through (2, 4) with slope 4>5:"},{"x":0.55462,"y":0.69521,"w":0.07236,"h":0.01982,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"y = 4 + 4"},{"x":0.6188,"y":0.70156,"w":0.06297,"h":0.02084,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"5 (x - 2)"},{"x":0.55461,"y":0.73013,"w":0.03985,"h":0.01982,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y = 4"},{"x":0.58628,"y":0.73013,"w":0.06414,"h":0.02719,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"5x + 12 5 ."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.77169,"w":0.59292,"h":0.02814,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"The normal to the curve at (2, 4) is the line perpendicular to the tangent there, the line through (2, 4) with slope -5>4:"},{"x":0.50555,"y":0.81348,"w":0.07236,"h":0.01999,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"y = 4 - 5"},{"x":0.56973,"y":0.81999,"w":0.06297,"h":0.02068,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"4 (x - 2)"},{"x":0.50555,"y":0.84839,"w":0.05319,"h":0.01999,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"y = - 5"},{"x":0.55057,"y":0.84839,"w":0.06414,"h":0.02719,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"4x + 13 2 ."}]}